problem: FUSE core existed but axiom-cli lacked a mount command and optional dependency
approach: Added optional axiomvault-fuse dependency/feature, mount subcommand, dispatch handler, docs, and verified default/fuse builds
failed_paths:
  - Initial targeted edits failed due unusual source formatting; rewrote small CLI/dispatch modules and ran rustfmt
verification:
  - cargo check -q
  - cargo check -q --features fuse
  - cargo test -q
  - cargo test -q --features fuse
  - cargo run -q --features fuse -- mount --help
workflow_learning: When feature-gating CLI subcommands, gate enum variant, module, and dispatch arm together so default builds avoid optional deps
related_files:
  - Cargo.toml
  - src/commands/fuse.rs
  - src/cli.rs
  - src/dispatch.rs
  - README.md
